  "stageId": "act17d0_06",
  "title": "領主宅邸攻防戰",
  "storyCode": "OD-6",
  "avgTag": "行動後",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act17d0/level_act17d0_06_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "2af663bee0cd50b1ab0f58649d4f7d4fa71a57a2807ad45d488fba1f66b07cb6",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "text": "已淨空！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "text": "好的，警戒交給你了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "text": "亞歷山大，看看躺在地上的雇傭兵還有沒有人活著！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "text": "馬上就辦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "text": "蒂娜，把繃帶拿來。我們清點人數，給傷患包紮一下。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FROST",
      "text": "好！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "text": "別裝死！！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雇傭兵",
      "text": "等等，把......把銃口移開！我什麼都說！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "text": "科茨，把他綁起來。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "text": "好的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "text": "醫生呢？米亞羅醫生！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "text": "在這裡！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米亞羅",
      "text": "......咳......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "text": "蒂娜！繃帶！快！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "text": "保持清醒！小伙子，不要閉上眼睛！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "text": "為什麼......發生什麼事了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "text": "強行使用源石技藝......源石感染擴散了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "text": "羅德島沒有辦法嗎？你們不是最擅長這個嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "text": "失血、灼傷、礦石病劇烈發作，就算是在羅德島本艦......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米亞羅",
      "text": "......咳......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "text": "撐住，小伙子。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米亞羅",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "text": "......堅持住，你不是還想遠遊他鄉嗎？想想你夢中的哥倫比亞。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "text": "......堅持住！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米亞羅",
      "text": "咳咳......咳......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米亞羅",
      "text": "......咳......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "text": "......醫生......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FROST",
      "text": "......他走了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "text": "......抱歉，我沒能......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "text": "不......不是你的錯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雇傭兵",
      "text": "......不......這和我沒關係，我不是負責的！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "text": "*俄語粗口*，今天你別想活著出去。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雇傭兵",
      "text": "......我只是......別......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "text": "你完了，*俄語粗口*，你死定了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雇傭兵",
      "text": "別！別打我！不是我幹的！別！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "text": "亞歷山大！別這樣！冷靜點！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "text": "那個衛兵隊長去哪兒了？就那位領主之女？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "text": "她追著逃走的人跑出去了，巡林者跟著她一起過去了，別擔心。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "text": "等等......醫生身上的結晶......在發光？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "text": "這？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "text": "這麼快？為什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "text": "！！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "text": "別管這個了！找個房間！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "text": "你們要做什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "text": "來不及解釋了！動作快！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "text": "找布料來！窗簾、床單，什麼都可以！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "text": "把醫生抬到那邊的小屋子裡！快！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "text": "發生什麼事了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "text": "醫生怎麼了？為什麼......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "text": "寇，寇恩小姐，請您冷靜一下，芙蘭卡已經在處理醫生的——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "text": "處理？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "text": "處理什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "text": "你們沒有見過嗎？我可能要之後再來解釋——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "text": "堵住門窗！不要留出縫隙！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "text": "煙囪！把煙囪也堵住！還有通風口！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "text": "這是......這是在做什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "BLITZ",
      "text": "不清楚？醫生的屍體......出什麼問題了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "text": "別去看。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "text": "為什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "TACHANKA",
      "text": "別去看......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "text": "上面堵死了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "text": "門窗堵死了！沒問題。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "text": "等等，屋子裡亮起來了？窗戶在發光？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "text": "寇恩小姐！別靠近！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "text": "別看......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "text": "到底發生什麼事了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "text": "醫生他......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ASH",
      "text": "啊......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
